BT /F2 13 Tf 72 595 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 575 Td (This policy defines acceptable and prohibited uses of MT&T Corporation's AI platform) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 562 Td (resources. It applies to all users of the Databricks-based AI infrastructure including model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 549 Td (serving endpoints, foundation model APIs, AI Gateway, Genie rooms, and associated tools.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 516 Td (2. Acceptable Uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 496 Td (MT&T's AI platform is approved for the following use cases: Customer experience improvement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 483 Td (through intelligent chatbots and virtual assistants, Network optimization and predictive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 470 Td (maintenance using ML models, Fraud detection and security analytics, Revenue analytics and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 457 Td (customer churn prediction, Internal knowledge management and document analysis, Data quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 444 Td (monitoring and automated anomaly detection, Self-service analytics through Genie rooms.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 411 Td (3. Prohibited Uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 391 Td (The following uses of MT&T's AI platform are strictly prohibited: Generating or processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 378 Td (illegal content, Using AI for employment decisions without HR and Legal approval, Accessing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 365 Td (competitor data or performing unauthorized competitive intelligence, Training models on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 352 Td (customer data without appropriate consent and privacy review, Using foundation models to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 339 Td (generate code for unauthorized systems, Sharing model serving endpoint credentials with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 326 Td (external parties, Bypassing AI Gateway guardrails or rate limits, Using production AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 313 Td (resources for personal projects or non-MT&T purposes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 280 Td (4. User Responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 260 Td (All AI platform users must: Complete MT&T's AI Ethics and Governance training before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 247 Td (accessing AI resources \(renewed annually\), Report suspected policy violations to the AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 234 Td (Governance team within 24 hours, Use the usage_context field in model serving requests to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 221 Td (identify their department and project, Review and acknowledge this policy annually through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 208 Td (the MT&T compliance portal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 185 Td (Model serving endpoint owners must: Monitor their endpoints through the AI Governance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 172 Td (Dashboard, Respond to utilization alerts within 2 business days, Participate in quarterly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 159 Td (cost optimization reviews, Maintain up-to-date Model Cards for all deployed models.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 126 Td (5. Monitoring and Enforcement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 106 Td (Compliance with this policy is monitored through: The AI Governance Dashboard and its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 93 Td (underlying system table views, Automated alerts on the v_ai_access_audit view for policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 80 Td (violations, Quarterly usage reviews by the AI Governance Committee, Annual audits by Internal) Tj ET
